@startuml sequence-login-refresh
!include _style.iuml
title Sequence - login, silent refresh and logout

actor User
participant "React SPA\n(Redux + Axios)" as SPA
participant "Caddy" as GW
participant "accounts API" as API
database PostgreSQL as PG
database "MongoDB" as MG

User -> SPA : email + password
SPA -> GW : POST /api/v1/auth/login/
GW -> API
API -> PG : authenticate (django-axes counts failures)
API -> MG : audit LOGIN
API --> SPA : 200 {access, user}\nSet-Cookie: ef_refresh (httpOnly, SameSite=Strict)
SPA -> SPA : store access token in memory

== 15 minutes later ==
SPA -> API : GET /api/v1/expenses/ (Bearer expired)
API --> SPA : 401
SPA -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/refresh/ (cookie)
API -> PG : blacklist old refresh token (rotation)
API --> SPA : 200 {access} + new cookie
SPA -> API : retry GET /api/v1/expenses/
API --> SPA : 200 page of expenses

== logout ==
SPA -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/logout/ (cookie)
API -> PG : blacklist refresh token
API --> SPA : 204, cookie cleared
@enduml
